>control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.440" end="00:33.352"><span begin="00:28.440" end="00:28.656">I </span><span begin="00:28.656" end="00:29.254">began </span><span begin="00:29.254" end="00:29.534">to </span><span begin="00:29.534" end="00:30.046">lose </span><span begin="00:30.046" end="00:33.352">control</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.583" end="00:36.999"><span begin="00:33.583" end="00:33.886">I </span><span begin="00:33.886" end="00:34.534">didn't </span><span begin="00:34.534" end="00:35.457">mean </span><span begin="00:35.457" end="00:35.710">to </span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:36.254">hurt </span><span begin="00:36.254" end="00:36.999">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.138" end="00:44.235"><span begin="00:39.138" end="00:39.368">I'm </span><span begin="00:39.368" end="00:39.887">sorry </span><span begin="00:39.887" end="00:40.843">that </span><span begin="00:41.116" end="00:41.299">I </span><span begin="00:41.299" end="00:41.748">made </span><span begin="00:41.748" end="00:41.995">you </span><span begin="00:41.995" end="00:44.235">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.100" end="00:48.764"><span begin="00:45.100" end="00:45.300">I </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.582">didn't </span><span begin="00:45.582" end="00:46.516">mean </span><span begin="00:46.516" end="00:46.764">to </span><span begin="00:46.764" end="00:47.301">hurt </span><span begin="00:47.301" end="00:48.764">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.430" end="00:53.020"><span begin="00:50.430" end="00:50.636">I'm </span><span begin="00:50.636" end="00:50.836">just </span><span begin="00:50.836" end="00:51.116">a </span><span begin="00:51.116" end="00:51.780">jealous </span><span begin="00:51.780" end="00:53.020">guy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.948" end="00:59.156"><span begin="00:55.948" end="00:56.167">I </span><span begin="00:56.167" end="00:56.429">was </span><span begin="00:56.429" end="00:57.237">feelin' </span><span b